WEBVTT

00:04:29.056 --> 00:04:30.433
or what they could afford.

00:04:31.058 --> 00:04:33.769
So I texted a few friends
I knew from around the country

00:04:33.769 --> 00:04:36.188
and put together a founding team.

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:39.317
Together we reached out
to 20 other musicians that we knew

00:04:39.317 --> 00:04:42.862
and asked each of them to teach
a free virtual private lesson a week

00:04:42.862 --> 00:04:44.989
to an underserved young student.

00:04:45.573 --> 00:04:48.367
This meant that students like Samuel Igbo,

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:51.746
a 14-year-old violinist
from a small town in Texas

00:04:51.787 --> 00:04:55.291
who dreams of pursuing a career
as a concert violinist,

00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:59.337
could receive personalized
musical mentorship from Nikki Naghavi,

00:04:59.378 --> 00:05:02.506
a prize-winning violinist
at the New England Conservatory.